WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:08.290
Welcome to Kloud Koach, your AI-powered interview coach. Let's take a quick tour.
First, create your free account in just a few seconds.

2
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:18.090
This is your dashboard, the home base for every coaching tool Kloud Koach offers:
three ways to practice, plus tools to prep your resume and study materials.

3
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:30.350
Live Interview Co-Pilot listens in on a real interview call in another tab, and
quietly suggests answers in real time. It's meant to help you think clearly,
not to answer for you.

4
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:41.070
Interview Preparation lets you rehearse out loud with your microphone. Ask a
practice question, and get a natural, spoken-style answer tailored to your resume.

5
00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:53.350
AI Interviewer takes it further. A simulated interviewer asks you real questions
out loud, one at a time, tailored to your uploaded resume, and gives you a full
score and feedback at the end.

6
00:00:54.600 --> 00:01:07.970
Upload your resume, and Kloud Koach AI structures it automatically. You can even
tailor it to a specific job description with one click. Exam prep, session
history, and plan upgrades are all just as easy to find.

7
00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:14.350
That's Kloud Koach. Log in, pick a mode, and start practicing. Good luck out there.
